Server init.
>> a := Blob ny: 4.
a bytes: ( Liste ny ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ny: 4.
b bytes: ( Liste ny ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a ny.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Uddata skriv: ['xorred:'], stop. 
Uddata skriv: n, stop. 
} fang: { :e Uddata skriv: e, stop. }, start.
a frigiv.
b frigiv.
